<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to attack civilians in Plateau, killing a 60-year-old woman harvesting groundnuts and injuring two farmers, and separate Fulani attackers killed a farmer and wounded another. In the north-east, unknown gunmen killed at least ten villagers in a raid after Friday prayers, with later reports raising the death toll to forty. Bandits abducted two farmers in a Kaduna community. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPcFpsdUFjTGVoX1A0SFZTS3ZMQl9wM0pPbzBNUkxoTHlCVEgzalJ5dEVjTVNweC0zQ1VLdE1ZVm9Ja3lpOW5uckVRM09CVEpKZEtBUWFhOFVfUDBZTFlsckdnQkZqRzh0YkpyUmpHa1B5X295QWVCMU52LXRoZkNpcnlPVFVGYmVkRHdLcHdQdjY2Vm5BRGUyZUg1Q3Y?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOb0tKb0MxcWJPd1UwM2hISUZXVlhOVnhUVUN1OTUwa3VmWTN1emxDOG5xNDRkOVNEUjViWEx0MEhRRG5qUEM5QzZhY0NZRUhVT1JKRHM3NmhHVTQ4M0QtdG9SSTV4VERBem9BNlJ2WmpqX3hnMVJmNTRoOVVPa0R5XzBmSThRazJ5ckp0N191MHhhbW9SVnBjQS1tUjBVdkw0MGVwZ0FKMDhDM3V2VUtnMk02dXRfTEhtVldibURCUE1pbjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dainik Jagran MP CG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goog